Package: udp
Type: Package
Title: Uniform Distribution Preserving Transformations
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Alexander J.", "McNeil",
      email = "alexanderjmcneil@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Tools for constructing and applying transformations that preserve
    the uniform distribution on the unit interval and unit hypercube. Provides
    utilities for building such maps and for checking the
    distribution-preserving property. Methods are described in McNeil (2021)
    <doi:10.3390/risks9010014> and McNeil, Neslehova and Smith (2025)
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2512.10828>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
